  "id": "e-in-charge-of",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 171,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "in charge of",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "主管，负责"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The teacher is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "in charge of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the class."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "这位教师负责这个班。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "in charge of 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：be in charge of 与 manage 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Mr. Brown "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is in charge of"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a large Disneyland Park in Japan."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Mr. Brown "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "manages"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a large Disneyland Park in Japan."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "布郎先生负责管理日本一家大型迪士尼乐园。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
